&quot;)<p>Please someone tell me how I can show the output in the mainPanel.<br>Since I&#39;ve been working on this issue for a couple of days, any information would be appreciated.<p><br>My ui.R is:<br># ----------<br>library(shiny)<br>shinyUI(pageWithSidebar(<br> headerPanel(&quot;Title&quot;),<br> sidebarPanel(<br>    numericInput(&quot;nx&quot;, &quot; Number of the 1st group:&quot;, 21),<br>    numericInput(&quot;mx&quot;, &quot; Mean of the 1st group:&quot;, 61.33333),<br>    numericInput(&quot;sdx&quot;, &quot; SD of the 1st group:&quot;, 16.43573),<br>    numericInput(&quot;ny&quot;, &quot; Number of the 2nd group:&quot;, 24),<br>    numericInput(&quot;my&quot;, &quot; Mean of the 2nd group:&quot;, 59.79167),<br>    numericInput(&quot;sdy&quot;, &quot; SD of the 2nd group:&quot;, 18.50729),<br>    checkboxInput(&quot;var.equal&quot;, &quot;equal variance&quot;, FALSE)<br>),<br>  mainPanel(<br>    tableOutput(&quot;values&quot;),<br>    uiOutput(&quot;result&quot;))<br>)<br>) <br># ----------<p><br>My server.R file is:<br># ----------<br>library(shiny)<br>shinyServer(function(input, output) {<br>sliderValues &lt;- reactive ({<p>data.frame(<br>        n = c(input$nx, input$ny),<br>        Mean = c(input$mx, input$my),<br>        SD = c(input$sdx, input$sdy),<br>        stringsAsFactors=FALSE)<br> })<p>my.t &lt;- function(  nx, <br>                        mx, <br>                        sdx,  <br>                        ny, <br>                        my,<br>                        sdy,<br>                        var.equal = FALSE, <br>                        )<br>{<br>    <br>    if (input$var.equal==T) {<br>        method &lt;- &quot; Normal t-test&quot;<br>        df &lt;- input$nx+input$ny-2<br>        v &lt;- ((input$nx-1)*input$sdx^2+(input$ny-1)*input$sdy^2)/df<br>        tstat &lt;- round(abs(input$mx-input$my)/sqrt(v*(1/input$nx+1/input$ny)),3) <br>    }<br>    else {<br>        method &lt;- &quot;Welch t-test&quot;<br>        tstat &lt;- round(abs(input$mx-input$my)/sqrt(input$sdx^2/input$nx+input$sdy^2/input$ny),3)<br>        df &lt;- round((input$sdx^2/input$nx+input$sdy^2/input$ny)^2/((input$sdx^2/input$nx)^2/(input$nx-1)+(input$sdy^2/input$ny)^2/(input$ny-1)), 3)<br>    }<br>    P &lt;- round(2*pt(tstat, df, lower.tail=FALSE),3)<br>    <br>    return(c(&quot;&quot;, method, &quot;
